<title>SOUTH KOREA: Two S.Korean firms seek 34,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Two S.Korean firms seek 34,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Dongah Flour Mills Co Ltd and Cheiljedang Corp have jointly invited tenders by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Wednesday to buy 34,000 tonnes of U.S. No. 1 wheat, traders said.</p>
